        en: { name: 'La Cuvette Beach', description: 'A tiny cove of fine sand shaded by trees, tucked behind the hotels on the western side of Grand Baie. The water is as calm as a pool and there are hardly any tourists.', tip: 'Look for the narrow public-beach path between the hotels on the road to Pointe aux Canonniers, and bring your own food, as there is no café nearby.' },
